    "text_blocks": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Opsumit (macitentan) can cause serious risks like birth defects and liver damage, as well as common side effects like headaches and nasal congestion.",
        "snippet_highlighted_words": [
          "headaches and nasal congestion"
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          0,
          1,
          2
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Severe Birth Defects: Opsumit causes major fetal harm and is strictly contraindicated during pregnancy. Effective birth control is required.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              0
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Liver Problems: Endothelin receptor antagonists can elevate liver enzymes and cause hepatotoxicity or liver failure. Doctors check liver function via blood tests before and during treatment.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              3,
              4,
              5
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Fluid Retention and Edema: Swelling in the hands, feet, legs, or face can happen, sometimes within the first few weeks. Severe fluid buildup can lead to pulmonary edema.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              6,
              7,
              8
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Anemia (Low Red Blood Cells): Decreased hemoglobin or red blood cell levels often appear early in treatment and may occasionally require a blood transfusion.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              4,
              6
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Decreased Sperm Counts: Reduced sperm count and impaired male fertility have been observed."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Stuffy or Runny Nose and Sore Throat: Nasopharyngitis and upper respiratory tract infections."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Headache"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "(airway irritation)"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Influenza (Flu)-like symptoms"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Urinary Tract Infections (UTIs)"
          }
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          3,
          3,
          4
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Review complete safety guidelines on the Opsumit Official Website or consult your healthcare provider.",
